Construction Apartments in South Bangalore | Puravankara","content":"The project is designed with open spaces, quality construction, and a wide range of amenities including a clubhouse, landscaped gardens, and fitness zones. Its proximity to IT hubs, schools, and healthcare facilities makes it a practical choice for both living and investment.\n\nDeveloped by Puravankara, it reflects reliability, transparency, and long-term value—key factors when choosing among residential projects in South Bangalore.\n\n## Investment Benefits of Ongoing Projects\n\n### Capital Appreciation\n\nBuying early in under construction apartments in Bangalore South allows you to benefit from price appreciation as the project nears completion.\n\n### Higher ROI Potential\n\nSince the entry price is lower, the return on investment tends to be higher compared to ready-to-move properties. [...] 3 bhk apartment in electronic city bangalore/uploads/Purva_Silversky_Website_Banner_1920px_X_1080px_26a4982d28.webp\n\n# Under Construction & Ongoing Projects in South Bangalore\n\nLooking for a home that gives you better pricing today and stronger value tomorrow? Then it makes sense to explore under construction apartments in Bangalore South. For many buyers, this category offers the right mix of affordability, flexibility, and long-term growth.\n\nOver the last few years, ongoing projects in South Bangalore have gained traction among both end-users and investors. Instead of paying a premium for ready homes, buyers are choosing projects in development stages to benefit from early pricing and appreciation over time.\n\n## Why Buyers Prefer Under Construction Apartments\n\n### Lower Entry Price [...] Most ongoing projects in South Bangalore offer construction-linked payment plans where buyers pay in stages based on project progress. This reduces the financial burden compared to paying the full amount upfront. It also allows better cash flow management for buyers. Some developers may also offer flexible schemes or limited-time offers during launch phases, making it easier to invest in under construction apartments in Bangalore South without financial stress.","score":0.46584973,"raw_content":null,"id":"860494-05"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/blog/top-10-under-construction-projects-in-bangalore","title":"Top 10 Under Construction Projects in Bangalore 2026 - |","content":"Divine Green Leaf, a breathtaking residential project situated in the bustling suburb of Yelahanka. Strategically connected to the vital Doddaballapur Road and NH 44, this project offers a tranquil escape from the hustle and bustle of city life. With a host of modern amenities, including a state-of-the-art gym, power backup, 24×7 security, clubhouse, and rainwater harvesting, Divine Green Leaf is a haven that promises to cater to all your needs and desires. The project boasts of spacious and beautifully designed 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments, ranging from 1120 sq. ft. to 1580 sq. ft. Each apartment is meticulously constructed with attention to detail, featuring high-quality finishes, doors, and windows.\n\n### Bhartiya City Nikoo Homes 6\n\nBhartiya City Nikoo Homes 6 [...] ### Sattva Lumina\n\nSattva Lumina \n\nSattva Lumina \n\nLocation: Yelahanka, Bangalore  \nStarting Price: ₹61.75 Lac onwards  \nStatus: Under Construction  \nUnits / Area: 1553 Units | 13.88 Acres  \nConfigurations: 2, 3 BHK Flats\n\nSattva Lumina is a premium residential township by Sattva Group, nestled in 13.88 acres of serene space in Yelahanka, Bangalore. Comprising 8 high-rise blocks with G+29 floors, it offers 1,553 thoughtfully designed studio, 1, 2, and 3 BHK apartments overlooking the tranquil Nagadasanahalli Lake. This expansive township combines spacious Vaastu-compliant homes with over 40 world-class amenities, making it one of the largest and most sought-after residential launches in North Bangalore for 2024.\n\n### Brigade Citrine\n\nBrigade Citrine \n\nBrigade Citrine \n\n### Mana Cresta [...] Located in the lively 100+ acre Bhartiya City in North Bengaluru, Nikoo Homes 6 reinterprets modern urban living by uniting nature, community, and urban amenities. Spread across 8 acres, this phase is designed as a true “Garden of Life”, where open spaces, themed landscapes, and everyday conveniences come together seamlessly. As part of this phase, a range of residences is offered by Bhartiya City Developers Private Limited, from studio suites and 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK homes to lofts and flexible layouts to accommodate families of any size. The size range starts from 470 sq ft to 2502 sq ft.\n\n### Sowparnika Euphoria\n\nSowparnika Euphoria \n\nSowparnika Euphoria","score":0.44724357,"raw_content":null,"id":"48d8e2-06"},{"url":"https://www.onecityproperty.com/news/why-under-construction-projects-in-bangalore-are-the-best-investment-right-now","title":"Under Construction Projects in Bangalore: Investment Guide 2026","content":"Fully equipped clubhouses, swimming pools, gyms, and indoor sports facilities. Co-working spaces within the complex for remote professionals.","score":0.4184836,"raw_content":null,"id":"afe897-07"}],"response_time":4.11,"request_id":"1f316daa-4ad0-4d19-ae11-4795cc45c50d"}